# `artifacts.delete`

Soft-delete an artifact by id.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.artifacts.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |

## Returns

`Deletion` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `deleted` | `bool` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call artifacts.delete --json '{ "id": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "artifact-checkout-audit",
  "deleted": true
}
```
